# OpenWeather API Configuration

## Endpoint

https://api.openweathermap.org/data/2.5/weather

## Query Parameters

* q=Makassar
* units=metric
* appid=${OPENWEATHER_API_KEY}

## Example Request

GET /data/2.5/weather?q=Makassar&units=metric

## Description

This API is used to retrieve realtime weather data
for the AI Agriculture Monitoring System.
